 "note": "Evidence, not an engine input -- parallel to senate_panel.json but for state governors. Nothing in engine/ reads this file. Office-holding roster, not election returns: no vote totals, no margins -- see hf7y/american-cycle#214.",
 "source": {
  "dataset": "United States Governors 1775-2020",
  "author": "Jacob Kaplan",
  "publisher": "Harvard Dataverse",
  "doi": "doi:10.7910/DVN/RYY3OW",
